{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026MxsYgdB7Nf1793178786.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>本周末萬聖節前夕，政府預計，皇崗口岸本周五至日晚上11時至凌晨2時，會出現過關高峰。政務司司長陳國基指，將實行公共交通優先政策，私家車過關輪候至少一小時。陳國基又呼籲旅客善用其他口岸，鼓勵留港過夜。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T11:01:30.858206+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T09:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T19:38:12.699777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T10:58:22.116608+00:00","content_hash":"96f03a7a98714775d13e45d219e31edf264b58f494fa39b8a6e35c24aa6fd9df","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T11:01:30.858206+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}